{"id":"200c387a518c40ae","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers.md","title":"Definition — 预层余积与逐点余等化子","display":"Definition — 预层余积与逐点余等化子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers"],"display":"Definition — 预层余积与逐点余等化子","source_ref":"I.5, pp.39–40","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层余积与逐点余等化子"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.5, pp.39–40"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((P_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为预层族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b:P\\to Q\">\\(a,b:P\\to Q\\)</span> 为自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span> 为源范畴箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_C\">\\(E_C\\)</span> 定义为包含指定生成对的最小等价关系；商类为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[q]_{E_C}\">\\([q]_{E_C}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\coprod_{i\\in I}P_i\\right)(C)=\\{(i,x)\\mid i\\in I\\land x\\in P_i(C)\\},\\qquad \\left(\\coprod_iP_i\\right)(u)(i,x)=(i,P_i(u)x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\coprod_{i\\in I}P_i\\right)(C)=\\{(i,x)\\mid i\\in I\\land x\\in P_i(C)\\},\\qquad \\left(\\coprod_iP_i\\right)(u)(i,x)=(i,P_i(u)x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_C=\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq Q(C)^2\\mid (\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;(q,q)\\in E)\\land (\\forall q,r\\;((q,r)\\in E\\Rightarrow(r,q)\\in E))\\land (\\forall q,r,s\\;((q,r)\\in E\\land(r,s)\\in E\\Rightarrow(q,s)\\in E))\\land\\forall p\\in P(C)\\;(a_Cp,b_Cp)\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_C=\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq Q(C)^2\\mid (\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;(q,q)\\in E)\\land (\\forall q,r\\;((q,r)\\in E\\Rightarrow(r,q)\\in E))\\land (\\forall q,r,s\\;((q,r)\\in E\\land(r,s)\\in E\\Rightarrow(q,s)\\in E))\\land\\forall p\\in P(C)\\;(a_Cp,b_Cp)\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coeq}(a,b)(C)=Q(C)/E_C,\\qquad \\operatorname{Coeq}(a,b)(u)([q]_{E_C})=[Q(u)q]_{E_D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Coeq}(a,b)(C)=Q(C)/E_C,\\qquad \\operatorname{Coeq}(a,b)(u)([q]_{E_C})=[Q(u)q]_{E_D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(C)^2\">\\(Q(C)^2\\)</span> 是等价关系候选之一，所以交的指标族非空。自然性把生成对送到生成对，故限制映射不依赖代表元。余等化子的商映射逐点满射；任何同时等化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 的自然变换唯一经商因子化，因子映射的自然性由商映射的满射性推出。余积通过保留指标的标签实现，空指标族给出各处取空集的初预层。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.5, pp.39–40。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"(P_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b:P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"E_C","display":false},{"tex":"[q]_{E_C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\coprod_{i\\in I}P_i\\right)(C)=\\{(i,x)\\mid i\\in I\\land x\\in P_i(C)\\},\\qquad \\left(\\coprod_iP_i\\right)(u)(i,x)=(i,P_i(u)x).","display":true},{"tex":"E_C=\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq Q(C)^2\\mid (\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;(q,q)\\in E)\\land (\\forall q,r\\;((q,r)\\in E\\Rightarrow(r,q)\\in E))\\land (\\forall q,r,s\\;((q,r)\\in E\\land(r,s)\\in E\\Rightarrow(q,s)\\in E))\\land\\forall p\\in P(C)\\;(a_Cp,b_Cp)\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Coeq}(a,b)(C)=Q(C)/E_C,\\qquad \\operatorname{Coeq}(a,b)(u)([q]_{E_C})=[Q(u)q]_{E_D}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q(C)^2","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false}],"bytes":1923,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers|df-187 — 预层余积与逐点余等化子]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers|df-187 — 预层余积与逐点余等化子]]"},{"id":"3d83677380a58c7f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$I\\in\\mathcal U$，$C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$，$(f_i:C_i\\to C)_{i\\in I}$ 为箭头族。$y$ 是[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]的 Yoneda 函子，$P=\\coprod_{i\\in I}y(C_i)$ 为[[14-df-presheaf-coproducts-and-coequalizers]]的带标签预层余积，所以 $P(D)=\\{(i,h)\\mid i\\in I,\\ h:D\\to C_i\\}$。$(a,\\eta)$ 是[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]的层化函子。$R_{\\boldsymbol f}$ 为此族生成的筛，$q_{\\boldsymbol f}$ 是下式构造的自然变换；满态射在层范畴中解释。"}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a"]}